      "sourceLine": 127,
      "section": "5.1",
      "kind": "body",
      "originalEn": "Kohlberg’s Theory of Moral Development and Gilligan’s Theory of Gender Differences",
      "textKo": "콜버그의 도덕성 발달 이론과 길리건의 성별 차이 이론(Kohlberg’s Theory of Moral Development and Gilligan’s Theory of Gender Differences)",
